@StudentManagementSystem_HostAddress = http://localhost:5211
@authToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.token}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. AUTHENTICATION & IDENTITY ENDPOINTS
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### Login as Default Admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{StudentManagementSystem_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@studentapi.com",
  "password": "Admin@123456"
}

###

### Register a New User (Teacher)
POST {{StudentManagementSystem_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teacher1@studentapi.com",
  "password": "Teacher@123456",
  "fullName": "Prof. Arvind Joshi",
  "role": "Teacher"
}

###

### Login as Teacher
# @name loginTeacher
POST {{StudentManagementSystem_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teacher1@studentapi.com",
  "password": "Teacher@123456"
}

###

### Get Current User Profile (Admin)
GET {{StudentManagementSystem_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Available Roles (Admin only)
GET {{StudentManagementSystem_HostAddress}}/api/auth/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Assign Role to User (Admin only)
POST {{StudentManagementSystem_HostAddress}}/api/auth/assign-role
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teacher1@studentapi.com",
  "role": "Admin"
}

###

### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. STUDENT MANAGEMENT ENDPOINTS
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### Get All Students (Default Paging)
GET {{StudentManagementSystem_HostAddress}}/api/student
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Search and Filter Students (Page 1, Size 5, Search "Rahul")
GET {{StudentManagementSystem_HostAddress}}/api/student?pageNumber=1&pageSize=5&searchTerm=Rahul&sortBy=Name&isAscending=true
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Filter Students by Course ("Computer Science")
GET {{StudentManagementSystem_HostAddress}}/api/student?course=Computer%20Science
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Student Statistics (Count by Course)
GET {{StudentManagementSystem_HostAddress}}/api/student/statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Student by ID
GET {{StudentManagementSystem_HostAddress}}/api/student/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Add New Student (Admin / Teacher only)
POST {{StudentManagementSystem_HostAddress}}/api/student
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tanvi Gaikwad",
  "email": "tanvi.gaikwad@example.com",
  "age": 21,
  "course": "Artificial Intelligence",
  "phoneNumber": "+91 9123456789"
}

###

### Update Existing Student (Admin / Teacher only)
PUT {{StudentManagementSystem_HostAddress}}/api/student/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rahul Sharma (Updated)",
  "email": "rahul.sharma@example.com",
  "age": 22,
  "course": "Data Science",
  "phoneNumber": "+91 9876543299",
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Delete Student by ID (Admin only)
DELETE {{StudentManagementSystem_HostAddress}}/api/student/4
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###
